{
  "about": "Wire-format contract between cirth-core (Rust, serde) and the editor (TypeScript, app/src/schema.ts). Both test suites must reproduce these values exactly: crates/cirth-core/tests/contract.rs and app/tests/contract.mjs. Canonical form: false flags and absent scene ids are omitted; adjacent runs never share the same marks; a block with no text has one empty run. Change this file only together with both sides.",
